# Subtask 1 - 1986

For this subtask, it should be easy enough to notice that, since all the years included are only between 1986 and 2015, there are no possible pairs of years to link together. You can simply pick any year (perhaps the first, for simplicity) and have that as the sole member of the thumbnail.
